# CLI-materialized artifacts inside project-tree fixtures.
# `ai-specs sync` writes these when it runs against a project root; they carry
# machine-specific absolute paths and must never be committed. Tests must copy a
# fixture to a temp dir before invoking the CLI (see test_target_resolve.py).
target-resolve/**/.claude/
target-resolve/**/CLAUDE.md
target-resolve/**/.ai-specs.lock
